n2. [](#bugfix)\n\t* Fixed color nav bg default value (was white, made it transparent).\n"},"1.7.0":{"date":"12-02-2020","content":"1. [](#new)\n\t* Complete color system revamp. (breaking changes)\n\t* Complete margin and padding for modular and utility class revamp. (breaking changes)\n\t* Nav color can now be added trough theme config and modular page blueprints.\n\t* Organization logo (for schema.org) can now be uploaded from theme config.\n2. [](#improved)\n\t* Article reveal.\n\t* GA script tag moved to 'after' js group.\n\t* Canonical is now set in base and no longer use an include.\n\t* Whitespace and line break management in multiple template.\n\t* Debug messages for snipcart and google maps.\n\t* Removed organization email and phone from theme config (not used anywhere).\n"},"1.6.7":{"date":"10-02-2020","content":"1. [](#new)\n\t* Better image handling for NewsArticle schema.\n\t* Modular role var in modular partial renammed to modular_role\n2. [](#bugfix)\n\t* Temporary fix for code tag overflowing.\n"}},"dependencies":[]},"whoami":{"name":"Whoami","version":"2.1.2","description":"Simple template for a portfolio","description_html":"<p>Simple template for a portfolio<\/p>","description_plain":"Simple template for a portfolio","icon":"user","author":{"name":"Alex","url":"https:\/\/rqwb.ru\/","email":"reqweb-dev@yandex.ru"},"dependencies":[{"name":"grav","version":">=1.6.0"}],"homepage":"https:\/\/github.com\/reqweb\/Whoami","docs":"https:\/\/github.com\/reqweb\/Whoami\/blob\/master\/README.md","demo":"https:\/\/whoami.rqwb.ru\/","keywords":"portfolio, blog, development","bugs":"https:\/\/github.com\/reqweb\/Whoami\/issues","license":"MIT","tag_name":"2.1.5","date":"2024-12-11T16:29:51Z","release_type":"stable","zipball_url":"https:\/\/getgrav.org\/download\/themes\/whoami\/2.1.2","repository":"https:\/\/github.com\/reqweb\/Whoami","slug":"whoami","install_path":"user\/themes\/whoami","content_sha256":"de042cf23db601e74c93876dff21df5191071318af095fbf6e0f637